# Copy this file to `.env.local` (gitignored) and paste your Liveblocks PUBLIC
# key to take boards online. Without it the demo runs in local-tabs mode.
#
#   1. Sign in at https://liveblocks.io and open (or create) a project.
#   2. Project → API keys → copy the public key (it starts with `pk_dev_` or
#      `pk_prod_`). Only the public key belongs here; never the secret key.
#   3. Restart `yarn dev` (Vite reads env files at start).
#
# The public key is compiled into the bundle by design: it only lets a
# browser enter rooms of that project. Rotate or restrict it in the dashboard.
VITE_LIVEBLOCKS_PUBLIC_KEY=pk_XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX
